<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<body>
  <table style="width: 100%; float: left; line-height: 30px; border: 5px solid #0000000d;padding: 0px 10px;" border="0">
    <tr>
      <td><img src="{{SERVER_DOMAIN_NAME_HEADER}}" style="width: 100%;"></td>
    </tr>

    <tr>
      <td style="background-color: #ffe6e6; border: 1px solid #ff4d4f; border-radius: 6px; padding: 14px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">
        <span style="font-size: 18px; margin-right: 8px;">⚠️</span>
        <b>Note:</b> {{COMPANY_NAME}} accepts payments only through official channels and is not responsible for
        payments made to unauthorized accounts or persons.
      </td>
    </tr>

    <tr>
      <td>
        <h1 style="text-align:center">LOAN SANCTION LETTER</h1>
        <p></p>
        Date: {{createdDate}}
      </td>
    </tr>

    <tr>
      <td>
        <b>Dear {{name}},</b>
      </td>
    </tr>

    <tr>
      <td>
        Thank you for selecting {{COMPANY_NAME}} for your loan requirements.
      We appreciate the trust you have placed in us to assist you.<br/>
        We are pleased to inform you that your loan application has been approved successfully.
        Kindly take some time to review the loan terms and repayment conditions provided.
      </td>
    </tr>

    <tr>
      <td>
      <table border="1" style="width:100%;text-align: center;border-collapse: collapse;padding: 12px;line-height: 25px;">
          <tr>
            <td><b>S.NO.</b></td>
            <td><b>PARAMETERS</b></td>
            <td><b>DETAILS</b></td>
          </tr>

        <tr><td>1</td><td style="text-align:left;">Name</td><td>{{name}}</td></tr>
        <tr><td>2</td><td style="text-align:left;">Loan amount</td><td>{{loanAmtApproved}}</td></tr>
        <tr><td>3</td><td style="text-align:left;">ROI (in % per day)</td><td>{{roi}}%</td></tr>
        <tr><td>4</td><td style="text-align:left;">Total interest charge during tenure</td><td>{{intem}}</td></tr>
        <tr><td>5</td><td style="text-align:left;">Processing Fee</td><td>{{adminFee}}</td></tr>
        <tr><td>6</td><td style="text-align:left;">GST 18%</td><td>{{gst}}</td></tr>
        <tr><td>7</td><td style="text-align:left;">Insurance charges</td><td>Nil</td></tr>
        <tr><td>8</td><td style="text-align:left;">Others (if any)</td><td>Nil</td></tr>
        <tr><td>9</td><td style="text-align:left;">Net disbursed amount</td><td>{{fdb}}</td></tr>
        <tr><td>10</td><td style="text-align:left;">Total Repayment Amount</td><td>{{rep1}}</td></tr>
        <tr><td></td><td style="text-align:left;">Repayment Date</td><td>{{repayDate}}</td></tr>
        <tr><td>11</td><td style="text-align:left;">Annualized interest rate</td><td>365</td></tr>
        <tr><td>12</td><td style="text-align:left;">Tenure of the Loan (days)</td><td>{{tenure}} days</td></tr>
        <tr><td>13</td><td style="text-align:left;">Repayment frequency</td><td>Day</td></tr>
        <tr><td>14</td><td style="text-align:left;">Number of installments</td><td>1</td></tr>
        <tr><td>15</td><td style="text-align:left;">Amount of each installment</td><td>{{rep1}}</td></tr>

        <tr><td colspan="3" style="text-align:left;"><b>Details about Contingent Charges</b></td></tr>
          <tr>
            <td>16</td>
            <td style="text-align:left;">Penal charges for delay</td>
            <td>{{penalintrest}} Delay Penal Interest Per Day & Rs {{penalCharges}} Penalty Over On Delay Period</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>17</td>
            <td style="text-align:left;">Cooling off period</td>
            <td>1 Day</td>
          </tr>
        </table>
      </td>
    </tr>

    {{!-- {{#if account_detail}}
    <tr>
      <td>
        <b>Your Bank Account Details:</b>
        <ul>
          <li>Bank Name: {{account_detail.bank}}</li>
          <li>Account No: {{account_detail.accountNo}}</li>
          <li>IFSC Code: {{account_detail.bankIfsc}}</li>
        </ul>
      </td>
    </tr>
    {{/if}} --}}

    <tr>
      <td>
        <b>1. Loan Details:</b>
        <ul>
          <li>Amount: ₹ {{loanAmtApproved}}</li>
          <li>Tenure: {{tenure}} days</li>
          <li>Product: Pay Day Loan</li>
          <li>Rate of Interest: {{roi}}% per day</li>
          <li>Repay Date: {{repayDate}}</li>
        </ul>
      </td>
    </tr>

    <tr>
      <td>
        <b>2. Interest Calculation and Payment:</b>
        <ul>
          <li>Interest will be charged from the date of disbursal until the payment date.</li>
          <li>You must repay the loan amount with accrued interest before due date.</li>
          <li>The repayment should be credited by {{repayDate}}.</li>
        </ul>
      </td>
    </tr>

    <tr>
      <td><img src="{{SERVER_DOMAIN_NAME_FOOTER}}" style="width: 100%;"></td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <!-- SECOND PAGE -->

<table style="width: 100%; float: left;  line-height: 30px;  border: 5px solid #0000000d;padding: 0px 10px;" border="0">
    <tr>
      <td><img src="{{SERVER_DOMAIN_NAME_HEADER}}" style="width: 100%;"></td>
    </tr>

  <tr><td><b>4. Prepayment Option:</b> You can prepay anytime without charges.</td></tr>
  <tr><td><b>5. Disbursement Process:</b> The loan will be disbursed to your registered bank account.</td></tr>
  <tr><td><b>6. Collateral and Security:</b> This loan is unsecured.</td></tr>
  <tr><td><b>7. Communication:</b> Updates will be sent to your registered contact details.</td></tr>
  <tr><td><b>8. Privacy:</b> Your data is secure as per data protection laws.</td></tr>
  <tr><td><b>9. Default Consequences:</b> Defaults may attract penalties and affect credit score.</td></tr>
  <tr><td><b>10. Legal Jurisdiction:</b> New Delhi, governed by the laws of Delhi.</td></tr>
    <tr>
      <td>
        <b>11. Customer Support:</b>
        For queries, contact us at {{company_mobile_no}}.
      </td>
    </tr>

    <tr>
      <td>
        We genuinely appreciate your trust in {{nbfc_name_show}} as your financial partner.
        By accepting this loan, you acknowledge and agree to these terms.
      </td>
    </tr>

    <tr>
      <td style="padding: 10px 0;">

        <div style=" background-color: #ffe6e6; border: 1px solid #ff4d4f; border-radius: 6px; padding: 14px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; ">

          <div style=" display: flex; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 8px; ">
            <span style="font-size: 18px; margin-right: 8px;">⚠️</span>
            <span style=" color: #d32f2f; font-weight: bold; font-size: 15px; ">
              Important: Fraud Prevention Notice
            </span>
          </div>

          <ul style=" margin: 0; padding-left: 20px; color: #333; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5; ">
            <li>{{COMPANY_NAME}} accepts repayments only through official company channels and authorized bank accounts.
            </li>
            <li>The company never asks for payments to personal accounts, UPI IDs, wallets, or unofficial
              numbers/emails.</li>
            <li>Please verify all payment requests through official customer care.</li>
            <li>{{COMPANY_NAME}} is not responsible for payments made to unauthorized persons or channels.</li>
          </ul>

        </div>

      </td>
    </tr>

    <tr>
      <td>
        <p>Warm regards,</p>
        <p>{{COMPANY_NAME}} (A Unit of {{nbfc_name_show}})</p>
        <img src="{{server_domain_name}}/images/sign.png" style="width: 100px;">
      </td>
    </tr>

    <tr>
      <td><img src="{{SERVER_DOMAIN_NAME_FOOTER}}" style="width: 100%;"></td>
    </tr>
  </table>
</body>
</html>
